ain back some  of the grounds  and indeed thousands turned out to show  their loyalty for sutter  friday's prayer was a display of power  on the part of the southwest movement  ahead  of the june elections but  anti-government protesters have  struggled to organize politically  to put up a serious challenge to  incumbent parties like the soldiers  further aiding their prospects for  electoral success  simona faulting al jazeera baghdad
 

